   "kind": "post",
   "text": "Our customers don't need more tools. They need the tools they have to do the work.\n\nThat's the idea Duncan Lennox, HubSpot's Chief Product & Technology Officer, brought to the UNBOUND 2026 stage. \n\nWe announced a self-updating CRM, brand-new Breeze Assistant and Marketing Studio, and more. All designed to help you build more demand, close more deals, and delight more customers. \n\nLink in the comments.",
