  {
   "id": "7508199655307124736",
   "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/hubspot_loop-outlearn-outmarket-outgrow-pre-order-activity-7508199655307124736-TMLu",
   "kind": "quote",
   "text": "It\u2019s officially launch day for Loop! We\u2019ve had a front-row seat as Kipp Bodnar and Kieran Flanagan wrote the book on what comes next in marketing, and we couldn\u2019t be prouder.\n\nCongratulations, Kipp, Kieran, and the rest of the team involved in bringing this fantastic, marketing resource to life!",
   "media": {
    "video": null,
    "images": [],
    "article": null,
    "document": null
   },
   "author": {
    "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/company/hubspot/",
    "info": "1,762,400 followers",
    "name": "HubSpot",
    "type": "company",
    "avatarUrl": "https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C4D0BAQF8H-SLmMDZlA/company-logo_400_400/company-logo_400_400/0/1646683330132/hubspot_logo?e=1793232000&v=beta&t=djgg6qOuiKghnlzjliRig3c19LoS4t3wPIlWVGdKzGQ"
   },
   "header": null,
   "postedAt": "2026-09-22T16:24:53.429Z",
   "repostOf": {
    "id": "7508124481979240448",
    "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/kippbodnar_loop-outlearn-outmarket-outgrow-pre-order-activity-7508124481979240448-ms4u",
    "text": "It\u2019s launch day. \ud83d\ude80\ud83d\ude80\ud83d\ude80\n\nLoop: Outlearn. Outmarket. Outgrow. is officially out. \u267e\ufe0f\n\nI helped scale the marketing playbook AI is now breaking.  \n\nWe had to rebuild our own. Today that rebuild becomes a book.\ud83d\udcd6 \n\nFor 15+ years at HubSpot, the job was clear: create useful content, get discovered, earn trust, turn trust into customers.\n\nThen buyers started getting answers without visiting websites. AI made content cheap. Almost everyone\u2019s response to less attention was produce more \u2014 including companies already producing too much.\n\nWhen you\u2019ve gotten good at something, it\u2019s easy to confuse \u201cthis worked\u201d with \u201cthis will keep working.\u201d\n\nSo Kieran Flanagan and I wrote Loop \u2014 a practical way forward for marketers who need next week to look different.\n\nThe idea: your marketing should get smarter every time you run it.\n\nA customer objection improves your next ad. That ad sharpens your positioning. That positioning makes the next conversation better. Every cycle raises the floor for the next one.\n\nThat\u2019s the system:\n\n\u2022 Express \u2014 your point of view and why you\u2019re worth choosing  \n\u2022 Tailor \u2014 make that story relevant to the person buying  \n\u2022 Amplify \u2014 show up where people actually discover, evaluate, and decide  \n\u2022 Evolve \u2014 feed what you learn back into everything next\n\nWe tested it inside HubSpot. The book brings the framework, the tools, and a plan to run it with your team.\n\nAI gives your competitors the same tools you have. Your advantage is what you understand about your customers \u2014 and how fast you turn that into better marketing.\n\nTo the HubSpot team, the Marketing Against the Grain community, and everyone who challenged these ideas along the way: thank you. You made this book better.\n\nIf you own growth and you\u2019re asking what your team should do differently next Monday \u2014 start here. Loop is live.\n\nGet your copy: https://lnkd.in/d9_MTk5u\n\nOutlearn. Outmarket. Outgrow.",
